ing by Google Analytics or other JavaScript-based code should still work as the URL of the page is not modified.','Tracking Parameters'=>'Tracking Parameters','WARNING: attempt to intercept updating of config file.'=>'WARNING: attempt to intercept updating of config file.','The location of the plugin configuration file can be changed by defining the WPCACHECONFIGPATH constant in wp-config.php. If not defined it will be set to WP_CONTENT_DIR.'=>'The location of the plugin configuration file can be changed by defining the WPCACHECONFIGPATH constant in wp-config.php. If not defined it will be set to WP_CONTENT_DIR.','Warning: do not use a shared directory like /tmp/ where other users on this server can modify files. Your cache files could be modified to deface your website.'=>'Warning: do not use a shared directory like /tmp/ where other users on this server can modify files. Your cache files could be modified to deface your website.','If you need support for this problem contact your hosting provider.'=>'If you need support for this problem contact your hosting provider.','Warning! You may not be allowed to use this plugin on your site.'=>'Warning! You may not be allowed to use this plugin on your site.','If it was created by another caching plugin please uninstall that plugin first before activating WP Super Cache. If the file is not removed by that action you should delete the file manually.'=>'If it was created by another caching plugin please uninstall that plugin first before activating WP Super Cache. If the file is not removed by that action you should delete the file manually.','The file %s was created by another plugin or by your system administrator. Please examine the file carefully by FTP or SSH and consult your hosting documentation. '=>'The file %s was created by another plugin or by your system administrator. Please examine the file carefully by FTP or SSH and consult your hosting documentation. ','%s/advanced-cache.php</em> cannot be updated.'=>'%s/adv